OL,4,G1600FJazz Record Requests
OL,5,     GAlyn Shipton present jazz records
OL,6,     Gof all styles, including music
OL,7,     Gfrom Camilla George, John
OL,8,     GMcLaughlin and the classic Joy
OL,9,     GSpring performed by Clifford
OL,10,     GBrown and Max Roach.
OL,11,G1700FThe Early Music Show
OL,12,     GHannah French visits Christ
OL,13,     GChurch College in Oxford, which
OL,14,     Gwas founded as Cardinal College
OL,15,     Gby Cardinal Wolsey in 1525.
OL,16,G1800FWords and Music
OL,17,     GWe're thinking big as we
OL,18,     Gcontemplate giants, looking at
OL,19,     Gthe expanse of the sea, sky and
OL,20,     Gcosmos and meeting a host of
OL,21,     Gfictional giants - and the odd
OL,22,     Gelephant.
